{"id":"n17199-2-5","stage":0,"title":"무엇 · 什么","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17199-2-5-1","ko":"무엇이라도 좀 마시겠습니까?","zh":"要喝点什么吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무엇이라도","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"2","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇이라도","audio":"/audio/21227d436f76adf2176e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"마시겠습니까?","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시겠습니까","audio":"/audio/51e352a97184be0159e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不确定或不需要明指的对象。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0c79deaa09890e4da14.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17199-2-5-2","ko":"커피 주시겠습니까?","zh":"请给我一杯咖啡好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"1","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}},{"text":"주시겠습니까?","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주시겠습니까","audio":"/audio/176672ce03a6379a8d36.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"炒熟制成粉后，放入沸水中喝的咖啡树果实；或指其粉末。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/615b7fa960da40d60fed.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":0.88,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17199","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":8,"sequenceScore":-0.0159,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["要喝点什么吗？","要吃点什么吗？","要买点什么吗？"],"answer":0,"explanation":"마시다 是喝；무엇이라도 좀 表示随便喝点什么。"},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请给我一杯茶好吗？","请给我一杯咖啡好吗？","您要喝杯咖啡吗？"],"answer":1,"explanation":"커피 주시겠습니까 是请求对方给自己咖啡，不是在给对方推荐饮料。"}]}
